WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.092
Run this query with several common table expressions and read it stage by stage.

00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:09.232
Admission counts has one row per patient with an admission count.

00:00:09.232 --> 00:00:15.477
Patient features joins that result to every patient and replaces missing counts with zero.

00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:20.842
The final select statement classifies repeat versus single or none.

00:00:20.842 --> 00:00:25.527
Notice how naming intermediate results makes the logic easier to discuss.
